  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:10 P.M. \\ Clear\nPenguin Logistics Base, Messy Room"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "So this is where Penguin Logistics holes up..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "(It's like a disaster area. And so dark.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "It's one of our bases. We haven't cleaned up in a while. Just sit wherever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Oh, thanks... I realize I didn't properly thank you, any of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "We did our jobs. You should introduce yourself first."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "I'm a Messenger, codenamed Bison. I'm from Lungmen, and I work for Mountain Dash Logistics. My father sent me to learn what I can from your company. And I appreciate the opportunity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Now about the contract between me and Mr. Emperor, I know we've already been over it, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Hold up, little man, I got a question. How'd your bigass daddy raise his boy to be so..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...Boss."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Yeah yeah, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Anyway, about that ambush, it was definitely meant to provoke a reaction from MDL and Penguin Logistics."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "We can't take this sitting down. I can contact my father and the LGD. This is a case of aggravated assault..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Hey, Texas."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "What's for dinner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "We're throwing a welcome party, of course! But where's Sora? Didn't she stay home to hold down the fort?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Ya know she'll come a-runnin' soon as Texas gets on the horn."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Oh, sorry. You were sayin'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "(Sora?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...Um, the first order of business is to figure out who attacked us. Does Penguin Logistics have any leads?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Leads? It's a pretty basic business dispute."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "What do you mean, business dispute...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Texas! Shouldn't I have a cigar in my hand by now?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Boss, it's been a while since we shacked up here. I think all your smokes went bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Sora came here to clean before. She might have thrown them away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Y'all for real? You tryin' to kill me? This is wack..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Yeah, you keep talkin.' Don't worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Our first step should be to figure out exactly what these attackers were targeting..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Hold up, we need some tunes! Get some vinyl spinnin'! We got a whole box of them here, don't we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Purdy sure I hauled one over. A box worth a couple months' salary."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Found it. What do you want to hear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Just throw on any one of 'em. Anything I picked out's gonna be fire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "It ain't life without music. Bless. Nice tunes, nice me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Bison, what else you got?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...Oh. Where was I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Their target."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Right! Well, their target was me, I guess, to try to provoke our two companies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "That's it? I figured it'd be some revenge thing..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "So you have a lead?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Sigh. Texas! Go scout 'em out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Triple overtime."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Um, we get into scuffles like that maybe twenty times a month. Doesn't every Messenger deal with this all the time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Messengers should be quieter, quicker... you shouldn't be settling everything with violence all the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Huh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "We're a logistics company. Why are we always getting involved in gang wars?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "cause they got no taste. They don't value their own lives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "And the baws signs our checks. We still get the goods where they need to go, all nice an' legal-like."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "It's just we usually end up doin' some armed transport."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Yeah. Like, what's the big deal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Umm...? You're really okay with that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Wait a minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Here, it's the passcode Sora left."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "C- cookies?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Aww, why'd she open them and leave them here. They're no good when they get all soggy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "The chocolate side is long, and the tail is short. That's the passcode."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "(That's some weird cryptography...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Really? She wasn't kiddin' with that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "...All I did was memorize what Sora said."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "'Suspect.' Hm. Maybe she chased them out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Let her go. It's quittin' time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "And we got Sauin, so no overtime. Forget about capitalist oppression. We gotta pour one out for the homies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Who's drinkin' with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Ooh, you buyin', baws? I heard some new top shelf booze just came in stock~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "S'all good. You ladies got a lotta pay to dock, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "No thanks!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Wait! We... we never came up with a plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Don't need one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "We just let the mob get away with this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "Play it by ear."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "...The LGD won't butt in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Probably not. They're used to this stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "It is what it is. Just go with the flow."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "But last month's property damage invoice was a little longer than usual. You all need to be more careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "So what's your typical work like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "We deliver the cargo in accordance with the contract, and then we fight. But if we have to fight, that kinda takes precedence."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Oh and jobs go to the boss first. Then it's first come first serve, whoever can handle them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Hey, little man. Your daddy trusted you to me. So you're part of the Penguin Logistics family now, even if it's just for a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "text": "Er, yeah... I get it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "And you gotta remember the first rule of Penguin Logistics: 'Don't sweat the small stuff.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Wasn't the first rule 'live for the party' yesterday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "The one I heard was 'carpe diem.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "...pretty much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Those ain't gonna be the last soldiers who wanna scoop you up and haul you off, but we're gonna take 'em one at a time. Simple as that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "Hold up, why's my ass feel funny? Somebody leave something in my perfect, ergonomic recliner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Um, I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Oh, what an adorable little candy box! Boss, you were hiding snacks under your chair!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "That's cap. Why would I stuff snacks in my... did you say candy box?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "It's a box of candies. See, it says 'Victorian Gumdrops' right here..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Get back, Exusiai, don't open the——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Gah! Get down."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
